10:Tc48,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"CreativeWork","name":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』山姥切国広 単独行 −日本刀史−","description":"荒牧慶彦演じる山姥切国広による、シリーズ初の一人芝居。修行の旅で日本刀の歴史を辿り、己が何者であるかを問い直す、孤独で静謐な自己対峙の物語。 強くなりたいという一心で本丸を離れ、修行の旅に出た山姥切国広。主への手紙を綴りながら、かつての迷いを晴らしていく。しかし、激化する時間遡行軍との戦い、そして三日月宗近が戦い続ける真意を想うとき、彼はさらなる強さの極致を求める。平安から現代に至るまで、日本刀が辿った悠久の歴史を彷徨い、数多の刀剣たちの想いに触れる旅路。写しとしての宿命を超え、一振りの刀として真のアイデンティティを掴み取るための、果てなき精神の軌跡を描き出す。","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/plays/touken-ranbu-stage-tandokugyo","keywords":"セリフ重め, 世界観つよめ, 演出強め, 刺さる/しんどい","about":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』（刀ステ）","actor":[{"@type":"Person","name":"荒牧 慶彦","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/aramaki-yoshihiko"},{"@type":"Person","name":"荒牧 慶彦","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/aramaki-yoshihiko"},{"@type":"Person","name":"荒牧 慶彦","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/aramaki-yoshihiko"},{"@type":"Person","name":"荒牧 慶彦","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/aramaki-yoshihiko"},{"@type":"Person","name":"荒牧 慶彦","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/aramaki-yoshihiko"},{"@type":"Person","name":"荒牧 慶彦","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/aramaki-yoshihiko"},{"@type":"Person","name":"荒牧 慶彦","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/aramaki-yoshihiko"},{"@type":"Person","name":"荒牧 慶彦","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/aramaki-yoshihiko"},{"@type":"Person","name":"荒牧 慶彦","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/aramaki-yoshihiko"},{"@type":"Person","name":"荒牧 慶彦","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/aramaki-yoshihiko"},{"@type":"Person","name":"岡田 達也","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/okada-tatsuya"},{"@type":"Person","name":"神農 直隆","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kamino-naotaka"},{"@type":"Person","name":"唐橋 充","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/karahashi-mitsuru"},{"@type":"Person","name":"富田 翔","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/tomita-sho"},{"@type":"Person","name":"山浦 徹","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/yamaura-toru"},{"@type":"Person","name":"一色 洋平","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/isshiki-yohei"},{"@type":"Person","name":"杉